# Built data.
#
# data/embeddings/ IS committed: 191 MB, all 40 slides as features + coords +
# per-patch scores with no pixel arrays. This is what the EA group consumes.
#
# data/slides/ is NOT committed: the same records plus the 224 px RGB patches,
# 2.3 GB. Regenerate with `python src/build.py build`, or re-cut any patch from
# the remote WSI using the stored `coords`.
